{"ref":"BDB, חָתַר","hw":"חָתַר","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָתַר</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. dig, row (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, <em>bore</em> (through), so Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲתַר</span> 𝔗 (rare)<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:16\" href=\"/Job.24.16\">Jb 24:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָתַרְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.7\">Ez 12:7</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶחְתֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.8\">Ez 8:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְתְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.12\">Ez 12:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:2\" href=\"/Amos.9.2\">Am 9:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְתְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:13\" href=\"/Jonah.1.13\">Jon 1:13</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲתָר־</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.8\">Ez 8:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.5\">12:5</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>dig into</em> houses, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּתִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:16\" href=\"/Job.24.16\">Jb 24:16</a> (of burglary); sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> into or through a wall <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.8\">Ez 8:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (Co del. on intern. grounds), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.5\">12:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.12\">12</a>; metaph. sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">בשׁאול</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:2\" href=\"/Amos.9.2\">Am 9:2</a> <em>dig into Sh</em><sup>e</sup><em>ʾôl</em>, i.e. as a refuge. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>row</em> (as <em>digging</em> into the water) <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:13\" href=\"/Jonah.1.13\">Jon 1:13</a>.","next":"BDB, מַחְתֶּ֫רֶת","prev":"BDB, חֶ֫תֶף"}